<div class="p-3 m-3 dark-translucent">
  <h2 class="bg-primary p-3 rounded shadow">
    <img src="images/node-icon.svg" height="90px" />
    Node.js Demo App
  </h2>

  <div class="lead mt-4">
    This is a simple Node.js web app using the Express framework and EJS templates. It has been designed with
    containers in mind, built and published with GitHub Actions and deployed with Dokploy — anytime you want
    something quick and lightweight to run & deploy 😄
    <br />
    <br />
    Basic features:
    <ul class="my-4 small">
      <li>System status / information view</li>
      <li>Prometheus metrics endpoint</li>
      <li>Geolocated weather info (from OpenWeather API)</li>
      <li>Tools for triggering errors and high CPU load</li>
      <li>Mini todo app using MongoDB data store</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>

